    <string name="game_icons_on_note">The app puts the small TouchForever addon into WoW before the game at every start and loads the icons of your abilities onto the device once. After changes to the bar in WoW, use /reload once, the \"Update icons\" button in the game, or a reload button from the element gallery.</string>
